‎
‎Marketing offers many career paths.
‎
‎Examples include:
‎
‎- Marketing Specialist
‎- Digital Marketing Specialist
‎- Social Media Manager
‎- Content Creator
‎- Sales Representative
‎- Brand Manager
‎- Affiliate Manager
‎- SEO Specialist
‎- Email Marketing Specialist
‎- Customer Success Manager
‎- Marketing Consultant
‎
‎These roles require continuous learning as technology and customer behaviour evolve.
‎
